<Components.shell root="" title={tp("About — EMOTHE")} current={:about} site={@site}>
  <article class="title-page">
    <h1>{t("About this edition")}</h1>
    <%!-- Text about the project itself comes from the project; add it here, by hand.
          The build states only what it knows. --%>
    <p>
      {tn(
        "This archive holds %{count} play, published as version %{version} on %{date}.",
        "This archive holds %{count} plays, published as version %{version} on %{date}.",
        @site.play_count,
        version: @site.version,
        date: @site.build_date
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{t("Reading")}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Every play has a title page, one page per act, the full text on one page, and its statistics; a play with notes has a page listing them, each linked to the word it glosses. Verse is numbered every fifth line; each line has its own address, so a link to it can be shared."
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{t("Citing")}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Each title page gives a citation for the edition. To cite a line, link to it: tapping a verse number copies its address and a citation."
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{t("Sources")}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "Each play's TEI-XML source is published beside its pages and can be downloaded from its title page."
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>{t("Principles")}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "The archive is plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no server and nothing loaded from elsewhere, following the"
      )}
      <a href="https://endings.uvic.ca/principles.html">{t("Endings principles")}</a>. {t(
        "It works the same opened from a disk."
      )}
    </p>
    <p>
      {t(
        "The band's links to the EMOTHE portal (Portal, Database) lead out of the archive to the site it belongs to, and need a connection; nothing a page needs to work is outside it."
      )}
    </p>
  </article>
</Components.shell>
